---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LegalNav from '../components/LegalNav.astro';
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="FTC affiliate disclosure for No Fluff Cruising. How sponsored content and partner links work on this site." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Disclosure", url:"/disclosure/"}]}>
  <div class="wrap"><article>
    <span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="answer"><b>The short answer</b>Some links on this site are affiliate or partner links. We may earn a commission if you book through them. Sponsored segments are labelled. Money never buys a verdict.</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Why this page exists</h2>
      <p>US advertising law asks publishers to tell you when a recommendation can earn them money. This page is that notice for No Fluff Cruising, operated by Matthew and Marlee.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate and partner links</h2>
      <p>We may earn a commission when you use certain outbound links, including free-quote and booking partners such as Member Cruises (nofluffcruising.membercruises.com). That commission does not raise the price you pay. It is how independent cruise sites stay funded.</p>

      <h2>Sponsored content</h2>
      <p>If a video segment or page section is paid for by a sponsor, we label it on the page and disclose it on the video. A sponsor does not write our verdict. A sponsor does not see a post before it publishes.</p>

      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>We sail without line loyalty. Affiliate relationships do not change which ships we cover or what we say about cost, food, cabins, or crowds. If a figure goes stale, we correct it in public. See <a href="/sources/">How we source</a>.</p>

      <h2>Your choice</h2>
      <p>You can read every guide and review without clicking a partner link. When you do click, know that we may be compensated if you book.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this disclosure: <a href="mailto:portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com">portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <LegalNav />
  </article></div>
</Base>
